          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "查看实际用量"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Usage and cost displays depend on data reported by each provider. Missing usage is not evidence that a request was free. Stop a run when it is no longer needed and verify charges with the provider.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Usage and cost displays depend on data reported by each provider. Missing usage is not evidence that a request was free. Stop a run when it is no longer needed and verify charges with the provider."
          }
        },
        "he": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "תצוגת השימוש והעלות תלויה בנתונים שהספק מדווח. היעדר נתוני שימוש אינו מעיד שהבקשה הייתה בחינם. עצרו הרצה כשאין בה צורך ובדקו את החיובים אצל הספק."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用量和费用显示取决于各服务商返回的数据。没有用量数据并不表示请求免费。不再需要运行时请停止，并向服务商核对费用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
