  "The capture could not be authenticated or exceeds the local review budget. The original files remain unchanged.": {
    "extractionState": "manual",
    "localizations": {
      "en": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "The capture could not be authenticated or exceeds the local review budget. The original files remain unchanged."
        }
      },
      "he": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "לא ניתן לאמת את ההקלטה, או שהיא חורגת ממגבלת העיון המקומי. קובצי המקור נשארו ללא שינוי."
        }
      },
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "无法验证记录，或记录超过本地查看限制。原始文件保持不变。"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Only this run will be decrypted in memory with this device's key. Requests and conversation text may contain private information. Nothing is uploaded or executed. Credentials are masked before review; sharing the reviewed report is optional.": {
    "extractionState": "manual",
    "localizations": {
      "en": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "Only this run will be decrypted in memory with this device's key. Requests and conversation text may contain private information. Nothing is uploaded or executed. Credentials are masked before review; sharing the reviewed report is optional."
        }
      },
      "he": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "רק ריצה זו תפוענח בזיכרון באמצעות מפתח המכשיר. הבקשות והשיחה עשויות להכיל מידע פרטי. לא יתבצעו העלאה או הרצת כלים. פרטי הגישה יוסתרו לפני ההצגה; שיתוף הדוח לאחר העיון הוא לבחירתך."
        }
      },
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "仅使用此设备的密钥在内存中解密本次运行。请求和对话可能包含私人信息。不会上传或执行任何内容。凭据会在查看前遮蔽；是否共享查看后的报告由您决定。"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Preview shows up to 65,536 characters. Sharing includes the full redacted report, not the encrypted source or device key.": {
    "extractionState": "manual",
    "localizations": {
      "en": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "Preview shows up to 65,536 characters. Sharing includes the full redacted report, not the encrypted source or device key."
        }
      },
      "he": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "התצוגה המקדימה כוללת עד 65,536 תווים. השיתוף כולל את הדוח המלא לאחר השחרה, ללא המקור המוצפן או מפתח המכשיר."
        }
      },
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "预览最多显示 65,536 个字符。共享包含完整的脱敏报告，不包含加密源文件或设备密钥。"
        }
      }
    }
  },
