          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请从回答中断的位置继续，保留之前的回答，不要重复已经完成的操作或工具调用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The answer reached the configured output limit. The partial answer is saved. Choose Continue to keep going.": {
